{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己找出怎样喜欢才不会受伤，先停下反复盘算该收住还是放开。\",\n      \"key\": \"停下盘算\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想让对方按自己的心意靠近，不愿为了让自己安心，把所有期待都压给对方，弄得两人不自在。\",\n      \"key\": \"两人不自在\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"虽仍没有答案，安心靠近、真心给予、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜都曾让他快乐，让他知道这个人有多重要，也让他愿意继续向前。\",\n      \"key\": \"继续向前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"以后若等不到对方主动靠近，他还是会疼，这不等于他先前的喜欢是假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"先前的喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想被这个人选择，也愿继续喜欢，不再因怕改变关系就把心意收回去。\",\n      \"key\": \"心意收回去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-1\", \"S14-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"将重复的无风险爱法收束为停止盘算，并把风险落到未来仍可能受伤、但不会因此否定过去的真心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-4\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"把仍想被选择的愿望与未来可能等不到回应的疼痛分开，避免反复宣布渴望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R67\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留对方可以按自己的心意靠近，也明说为了安心把全部期待压给对方，会让两人无法自在相处。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R70\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足因果\",\n      \"why\": \"保留四种曾带来快乐的亲近方式，并明确这些经历让他看见这个人有多重要，也让他愿意继续向前。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R73\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\", \"S14-4\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把对对方自由的尊重、未来疼痛不抹掉真心，以及仍愿继续喜欢，落实为具体想法和选择，不再堆叠抽象原则。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e33eedcf-2398-4a33-93d0-a652d7e95c07", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T145302777308Z", "elapsed_seconds": 908.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:08:11.411947+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3d5204feb0984e79ba1a151adbb2c41a389421a10cf899b9b0f6b3d7ee64c28b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc495870